  {
   "id": "never-grave-the-witch-and-the-curse-250291@major-2026-03-12",
   "gameId": "never-grave-the-witch-and-the-curse-250291",
   "displayName": "[Important] Update Status and Multiplayer Version Compatibility",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-12T10:00:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Regarding the recently released v1.3 update, we would like to provide an update on the status across different platforms and important precautions for multiplayer gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ Changes to Multiplayer Matching",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Starting with update v1.3, we have introduced a new \"Version Check\" feature to improve multiplayer stability. As a result, matchmaking between different game versions will now be restricted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you attempt to play multiplayer (Private Rooms) in an environment where the latest v1.3 and the older v1.2 versions are mixed, please note the following:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Host is v1.2 / Guest is v1.3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Matching is not possible. The connection will be blocked by the version check feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Host is v1.3 / Guest is v1.2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Matching may be possible, but we cannot guarantee stable gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In particular, since the acquisition mechanics for \"Blueprints\" and \"Divine Weight\" differ between versions, you may encounter unexpected bugs, such as rewards failing to sync correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ Platform Distribution Schedule",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The v1.3 update is currently being rolled out first on the Steam platform.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For those playing on other platforms, we sincerely apologize for the delay in the delivery of this update. We are doing our absolute best to prepare the release so that all players can enjoy the latest experience as soon as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To our players on other platforms waiting for this update: we truly appreciate your continued support and valuable feedback. We will provide further information as soon as the release date is confirmed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The development team remains fully committed to providing a stable and enjoyable adventure for all players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
