  {
   "id": "never-grave-the-witch-and-the-curse-250291@1.3",
   "gameId": "never-grave-the-witch-and-the-curse-250291",
   "displayName": "Update 1.3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-11T03:03:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In this update, we have focused on enhancing the multiplayer experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "▼ New \"Random Matchmaking\" for Multiplayer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "・We now support two ways to play together",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Public Rooms: Match with random players. Hosts can toggle permissions for guests to build facilities and specify the type of players they are looking for.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Private Rooms: Uses the existing \"Room ID\" system, perfect for playing with specific friends.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Multiplayer QoL Improvements: Guest players can now obtain \"Blueprints\" and \"Divine Weight\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: To preserve the integrity of the single-player story progression, Blueprints gifted by NPCs remain unchanged and cannot be obtained by guest players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Griefing Prevention: With the introduction of matchmaking, hosts can no longer change the difficulty mid-game to prevent malicious interference with the gameplay experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "▼ New \"VERY HARD\" Difficulty",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added the \"VERY HARD\" difficulty setting and included brief descriptions for each difficulty level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "▼ Boss Adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Reduced the Max HP for the \"Garden Boss\" and the \"Final Boss.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "▼ Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue where Villagers and Guards would occasionally spawn at the same coordinates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "▼ Stability Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Implemented partial fixes for crashes and frame drops caused by program errors or insufficient VRAM.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・Since stability can be affected by various hardware environments, we will continue to investigate and release updates to improve performance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We heard your strong requests for a \"Random Matchmaking\" feature and have prioritized its implementation!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As this is the initial release of the feature, it may still feel a bit unpolished. If you encounter any issues while playing, please feel free to contact our support team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Never Grave will continue to evolve! We appreciate your continued support and patience as we work on future updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44134908/25f48b218729b30d5bea58d6e42c40b845181746.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
